•the expected impact of global business, political, and macroeconomic conditions, including inflation, interest rate volatility, cybersecurity events, potential instability in the global banking system, volatile market conditions, the impact of tariffs, the impact of any significant political and regulatory developments, global events, including public health crises, and ongoing geopolitical conflicts, such as the wars in Ukraine and Iran and conflicts in the Middle East and Venezuela, on our business, operations, and financial results;

